# EscortWaitSpot4 ($A5:EF2B), EscortWaitSpot0's restart point: the escort
# goes there when, following Aladdin, he is more than 192 pixels to its
# left (ActorRestartIfPlayerFarLeft). On pw4.state the escort (record
# $092B, its restart point $EF2B) waits at spot 0, x $0530, for him to
# come near; he is at x $003A. Its x is put at $0040, by him: it starts
# to follow; two frames on its x is put back at $0530, and its next
# check sends it to spot 4, where it waits again.
load build/aladdin/states/pw4.state
wait 10
poke 000937 40,00
wait 2
poke 000937 30,05
wait 30
dump z
